{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-03_end","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-03","title":"无罪推定","storyCode":"2-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-03_end.txt","sourceHash":"946ee195ebd9da22d6f2f00cd2b02e5f2e47476203077cd9b5f36eb2d01a657a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在废弃的大楼中，罗德岛一行找到了米莎。\n一番交谈后，米莎虽然不情愿，但还是选择了跟随罗德岛离开。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第十五关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......躲在这里，就不会被发现了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"就算这样，也没法再回孩子们那里去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不会有事吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是米莎小姐吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......咦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，米莎小姐，希望没有吓到你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的同事，芙兰卡小姐和雷蛇小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"你好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"中午好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是罗德岛制药。作为一个为感染者服务的组织，至少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也希望能帮到你什么。所以想和你，交流一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"交流一下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这里也不太合适......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在，最需要的是能保证米莎小姐你的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间里，我们会保护你，请不用担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在说什么......啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是把我抓住关起来吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"走开！我的爪子很锋利的......！不想受伤的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"你......笑什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们真的想抓你，你是根本没机会反抗啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎小姐......我们是真的想帮助你，所以才......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"我不相信你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门对待感染者，比对待罪犯还严苛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"你凭什么，凭什么要帮助感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——米莎小姐，你看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"你在——干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是......感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我和你一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门贫民区藏匿着许多感染者......刚才的孩子们......她们很信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎，你已经让他们陷入了危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是想用孩子们威胁我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不会。但已经有人这么做了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛刚刚赶走过一批胁迫孩子们的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":".......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门同样也在搜查感染者。等到龙门发现你的话，可能就晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们想通过你把暴徒们从孩子们身边引开——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"另一方面，我们也可以保护你，让你不受伤害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道他们为什么抓我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......又为什么要保护我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我其实并不太清楚，为什么会有感染者针对你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我们也在乎无辜感染者的安全，包括你。至少这样是目前最好的解决办法。我也只能希望你能相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"请先允许我们带你离开这里，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就......走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米莎","speakerId":"char_012_misa","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，我没什么选择，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是这么说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，谢谢你......米莎小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_012_misa","aliases":["米莎"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["芙兰卡"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["雷蛇"]}]}
